{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月27日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261127.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】運輸署下周一起接受網約車車輛駕駛許可證「人牌」申請，上限一萬個，當中有甚麼申請資格？業界的反應是怎樣？</p><p>周五的《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論。</p><p>題目：網約車駕駛許可證申請</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T12:03:53.516935+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:26:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.241609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:57:26.703650+00:00","content_hash":"c6bc91c0d9d2bfeec25de2d1f426358b1e3f9cc00fc0b6c1455ddcbb7dbcf48b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T12:03:53.516935+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}